*Description of changes:*

This change adds a user ID module to the aws swift SDK. This will populate a user ID into all telemetry. User ID will be persisted in UserDefault and will be fetched if available. A new user id is created only when it cannot be fetched from UserDefault. 


Much of the code is borrowed from sessions implementation and I have attempted to align this as much as possible 


*Testing* 

- Unit test are included 
- Manual local testing shows the user id added and persisted

